  "longBusinessSummary": "WASGAU Produktions & Handels AG engages in the food business in Germany. The company operates through Retail and Wholesale segments. It operates a bakery that sells bread, rolls, cakes, pastries and snacks, and daily meals; a butchery that provides meat and sausage products; a fruit and vegetable garden; and a wine cellar, as well as champagne under the WASGAU brand. In addition, the company sells wine accessories and spirits; coffee and espresso. Further, it offers coffee and espresso machines; and manual and electric coffee grinders through its online shops. The company was founded in 1925 and is based in Pirmasens, Germany. WASGAU Produktions & Handels AG operates as a subsidiary of Wasgau Food Beteiligungsgesellschaft mbH.",
